# The repository root ignores every lib/ directory (Python build artifacts).
# This package keeps its DSH host source in lib/, so re-include that directory.
# Re-including the directory is what matters; a file cannot be re-included while
# its parent directory is still excluded.
!lib/

# The root also ignores data/ for model datasets. The plugin's data/ directory
# holds a small generated sample index and panel previews that must ship with it.
!data/

# Local test inventories and persisted reports. Tests may create these files while
# exercising the host half; they are disposable state, never package content.
test/.no-inventory.json
test/.client-render-inventory.json
test/ascend310b-reports.json
test/*-reports.json
test/*-inventory.json
test/.serial-sessions/
